        starter: `students = {\n    "Alice":   [90, 85, 92],\n    "Bob":     [78, 82, 80],\n    "Charlie": [95, 98, 92]\n}\n\ndef letter_grade(avg):\n    # return A/B/C/D/F\n    pass\n\nfor name, scores in students.items():\n    avg = sum(scores) / len(scores)\n    grade = letter_grade(avg)\n    print(f"{name}: {avg} — {grade}")\n`,
